5,1,1,talk,George,,I worry the car is already changing how we talk to each other.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to see where the actual time goes before we agree to anything.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I need to understand the daily friction. How does the car feel to use on a normal morning?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I need to verify the baseline costs. I will check the tax, insurance, and parking papers from last year.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want to know what the car really costs. I will look at the fuel receipts from last year.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,George,,"@Toshio, time is important, but I am more concerned about the social strain. We need to look at the diary.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, the diary shows hours, not feelings. I need the mechanic's remarks to see if the car is failing us.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, the mechanic’s notes are vital, but I need to see the state of the car at handover. That’s where the friction starts.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, the handover state is crucial for fairness. I will also check the mechanic's remarks to see if the car is failing us.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, that sounds good. I will also look at the hours of use recorded in the diary to see who drives.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,George,,"@Minato, the diary shows who drives, but not why the silence happened. I will check the spell of checking each other's figures.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@George, checking figures is just arithmetic. I will look at the weeks of heavy use to see the actual pattern.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, heavy use weeks are useful, but I need the state of the car at handover. That is where my morning anxiety begins.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, I understand the anxiety. I will also check the state of the car at handover to see if the friction is physical.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I hope the car is okay. I will also look at the trips that repeat weekly to see the pattern.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,George,,I will also look at what two other car-sharing households said. Their experience might explain our silence.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will also check the month's trial of recording every run. I need to see the true cost of each trip.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
