35,2,1,talk,George,,The other households said the souring came from asking favours or clinging to unneeded turns.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The trial took an hour weekly just to square the numbers. That is the real cost, not the fuel.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The fuel light and rubbish confirm my fear. The weekly trips collapsing means my routine is the first casualty.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The fixed costs are 280,000 yen. That is a heavy baseline. I need to see how the variable costs split against this.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,The receipts show two people bought most of the fuel. The diary says Saturdays are busier. I am a little confused by the gap.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,George,,"@Minato, that gap is exactly the friction. The other households said clinging to unneeded turns sours things.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Minato, that gap is the administrative burden. The trial proved the bookkeeping is the real expense, not the petrol.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, bookkeeping is necessary, but it doesn't fix the empty tank. I need a system that guarantees the car is ready for my specific weekly trip.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, I agree the tank matters, but the 280,000 yen baseline is fixed. We must ensure the variable costs don't hide who is actually subsidizing whom.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, I agree. I just want to see the real numbers so we can share the cost fairly.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,George,,"@Toshio, the bookkeeping burden is real, but the social cost is higher. We must avoid the favour-asking trap.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@George, I agree. The social cost is the hidden tax. We need a system that removes the need for favours entirely.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@George, I agree. But a system that removes favours must also guarantee the car is physically ready. I cannot drive off with rubbish inside.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Toshio, I agree. The social cost is the hidden tax. We need a system that removes the need for favours entirely.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@George, I worry about hurting feelings. Maybe we can just agree on a simple, kind way to share the driving?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,George,,"@Minato, kindness is good, but it is not a system. We need rules that prevent the favour trap before it starts.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Minato, kindness is fragile. We need a rigid structure that makes the car self-managing, so no one has to ask.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Minato, kindness is not a guarantee. I need a physical check before I drive. If the car is not ready, I cannot leave.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, kindness is not a ledger. I need the numbers to be precise so no one is quietly subsidizing the rest of us.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, I understand. I just want the numbers to be clear so we can all feel safe and fair.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
